<h1>Your approval link expired</h1>

<p>
  Hi <%= @user.name %> — the approval link for the character
  <strong><%= @character.name %></strong> in your project
  <strong><%= @project.name %></strong> expired before it was used.
</p>

<p>
  No action was taken and your character is still waiting. Open the project to
  review it and send a fresh approval link:
</p>
<p><a href="<%= @project_url %>"><%= @project_url %></a></p>
